Depends: svent-core, perl, libnet-ssleay-perl, libio-socket-ssl-perl, libxml-writer-perl, libjson-pp-perl, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent web tool: nikto (vendored)
 Web server vulnerability scanner, bundled under /opt/sv-nikto with its own
 LW2 library. The required Perl modules come from Debian as shared,
 co-installable system libraries, so nothing else is affected.
